> Complete preserved experiment

The original first/every-visit comparisons retain all episodes, decaying epsilon, evaluation and best-of-three seeded playback. First visits are identified by a forward scan before the backward return calculation. All objectives, policy improvements, optimizer steps, collection and evaluation loops remain editable below. Additional checkpoint writes consume no RNG draws. The seeded greedy rollouts are recorded with the native grid renderer.

```{cpp, results="output", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
