> Interpretation and provenance

Read online reward, greedy evaluation and any auxiliary bonus as separate quantities. The source checks remain part of the executable experiment; success means those particular seeded checks passed. No result here asserts TensorFlow equivalence without its recorded fixtures. Canonical APIs contain reusable state representations and mathematical operations; every fitting, episode and convergence loop is visible in this report.

